<title>USA: Line Mountain SD, Pa., adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>Line Mountain SD, Pa., adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Line Mountain School District, Pa., said Wednesday it recalculated RRZ Public Markets Inc's winning bid on the District's $4.995 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The District said the true interest cost was 5.208 percent reflecting the cost of bond insurance, not the 5.178 percent originally calculated.</p>
